  "artifact_text": "### Observations\n1. Pod `notifications-worker-6784d8b8df-lk5l8` logs report `ERROR notifications-worker: missing required setting SMTP_PASSWORD (environment variable is unset or empty)` and exit with code 1.\n2. Deployment `notifications-worker` was updated at 2026-10-23T08:24:18Z under deployment record CI-2459 to require settings from environment variables instead of config files.\n3. The deployment manifest references secret `notifications-smtp` key `SMTP_PASSWORD` with `optional: true`, leaving the environment variable unset if missing in the secret.\n\n### Ruled-out leads\n1. OOMKilled was ruled out because pod container termination reason is `Error` with exit code 1 rather than `OOMKilled` (pod status `status.containerStatuses[0].lastState`).\n2. Missing secret mount was ruled out because deployment CI-2459 intentionally migrated configuration to environment variables via `secretKeyRef`.\n\n### Root cause\nDeployment CI-2459 introduced mandatory `SMTP_PASSWORD` environment variable validation in v2.0.0, but Secret `notifications-smtp` does not provide the matching key.\n\n### Recommended action\nThe notifications team should update Secret `notifications-smtp` to include `SMTP_PASSWORD` or revert deployment CI-2459.",
